{"description": "Pixel art TV home shopping broadcast frame, a 2000s CRT TV shot, 4:3. DEPTH: camera slightly above eye level, one-point perspective; the side set panels angle inward toward the back wall; layers from front to back: the counter, the host, the bulb arch, the angled side panels, the back wall with a screen set into it, the truss. MAIN SUBJECT, LARGE: the show host fills the left half of the frame from just above his head down to the counter, head to waist. Realistic adult proportions: small head, broad shoulders, long torso, not chibi. DYNAMIC POSE: body turned three quarters toward the right, leaning forward toward the camera, his right arm stretched down to the right toward the counter, open palm up presenting the product stand beside him, his left hand holding a handheld microphone at his chest, face toward the camera. Black suit, white shirt, dark red tie, combed black hair, unnaturally white made-up face, eyes completely black with no whites, thin closed-lip smile, no teeth, no headset. FOREGROUND: a glossy red and black display counter across the bottom quarter of the frame: a narrow top surface receding toward the back, then a single vertical front face running straight down to the bottom edge, hiding his body below the waist; the front face has one row of unlit round marquee bulbs and one row of unlit square light tiles. On the counter top just right of his hand: a low round striped turntable stand, its top empty. BACKGROUND: red and black lacquer set panels with gold trim; an arch of unlit round marquee bulbs behind his head; on the back wall at the right a large flat studio screen set into the wall, framed by evenly spaced unlit round bulbs; three unlit spotlights on a truss at the top right. All decorative lights and the screen switched off: dark glass, no glow, no beams. LIGHT: studio key light on his face and hands, deep black shadows. Dense, highly detailed pixel art, crisp pixel clusters, no dithering, no blur. No letters, no words, no other people.", "image_size": {"width": 592, "height": 444}, "no_background": false, "reference_images": [{"image": {"type": "base64", "base64": "", "format": "png"}, "size": {"width": 592, "height": 444}, "usage_description": "LAYOUT, SIZE, DEPTH AND POSE from this line drawing: side panels angling inward; the host head to waist on the left, this big, turned right, right arm stretched down-right with the open palm beside the turntable, microphone at the chest; the counter across the bottom with a narrow top and one vertical front face with bulb row and tile row; the bulb arch behind his head; the bulb-framed screen on the back wall. Do not copy the white or the lines."}, {"image": {"type": "base64", "base64": "", "format": "png"}, "size": {"width": 390, "height": 105}, "usage_description": "PIXEL SCALE: these product icons will be placed on the turntable at exactly this pixel size. Match their pixel density, outline thickness and shading. Do not draw these objects."}]}